  "name": "Wine and Garlic Pork",
  "subtitle": "Tender pork marinated with red wine, vinegar, garlic, and herbs",
  "description": "Marinate cubed pork in a seasoned wine-and-vinegar mixture, then bake and finish it in hot oil for a browned, savory main dish.",
